      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Something didn't notice before, but JudyWei seems to have learned that despite the OpenVR limit for devices being 64, the Unity plugin seems to be stuck at the 16 devices limit (and this seemed to be the source of the issue for Judy, who was running 8 tundra trackers, 4 base stations, and a Quest 2 and could not get the last SteamVR tracked device to be detected). This makes it very inconvenient for cases like Judy's (mixed tracking, high device count especially), as even base stations being listed as devices in SteamVR can cause device recognition issues.  \nhttps://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/946881839400882196/980874725536444446",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
